      en: ["The stadium was officially called Stade de la Révolution until its renaming.", "It accommodates approximately 10,000 spectators for sporting events.", "The name Intwari translates to 'Heroes' in the Kirundi language.", "It is frequently utilized for training sessions by local top-flight clubs.", "Numerous national celebrations are hosted on these grounds.", "The facility also includes areas for track and field competitions."],
