      en: ["The palace serves as the venue for official state visits and receptions.", "It was constructed during the post-independence period (after 1962).", "Architecturally, the building combines functional and monumental styles.", "Public access is strictly limited due to high security protocols.", "Major international treaties have been signed within its halls.", "It is located in close proximity to other vital government institutions."],
