      en: ["The building houses the executive offices of the Mayor of Bujumbura.", "It is located near the Central Market and the Bank of the Republic of Burundi.", "The City Hall oversees the administration of the city's various communes.", "Bujumbura served as the sole capital of Burundi until late 2018.", "The facility is the primary location for civil marriage ceremonies in the city.", "It plays a key role in urban planning and public service coordination."],
      es: ["Construido en la década de 1950", "Estilo neoclásico", "Torre del reloj de 40 metros", "Fachada con columnas", "Renovado en 2012", "Plaza de la Independencia al frente"],
