      en: ["The hospital was established in 1949 during the colonial period.", "It honors Prince Charles of Belgium, who was Regent from 1944 to 1950.", "The facility is a primary teaching hospital for the University of Burundi.", "It is located in the Buyenzi district, a central area of Bujumbura.", "The hospital includes a specialized center for maternal and child health.", "It serves as a tertiary referral center for cases from across the country."],
      es: ["Construido en 1935", "800 camas", "Más de 1.000 empleados", "Nueva sala de emergencias en 2016", "Hospital universitario", "100.000 pacientes ambulatorios al año"],
